  "releaseNotes": "CacheOrchestrator 3.0.0-beta.5\n\nv3 beta.5 fixes authenticated cache-key collisions, HTTP representation identity, entity-footprint tag publication, EF transaction-aware invalidation, and Redis backend isolation. Runtime settings update atomically, cluster commands report incomplete execution, and queued Edge purges retain their original destinations. Public API contracts, documentation, regression coverage, and package/analyzer checks are aligned for 3.0.\n\nFull notes: https://github.com/CacheOrchestrator/CacheOrchestrator/releases/tag/v3.0.0-beta.5",
